# Stack

Next.js App Router, React 19, Auth.js v5 (JWT), Drizzle + Neon (`DATABASE_URL` pooled), Zod env in `src/env.js`, shadcn + Tailwind 4, TanStack Query, pnpm, Node 24.

# Editing

- Minimize diff; match existing `~/` imports and file layout.
- DB: `src/server/db/schema.ts` + `env.DB_TABLE_PREFIX` for all table names.
- Auth: `src/lib/auth.config.ts` / `src/lib/auth.ts`; credentials use argon2 in `src/server/auth/password.ts`.
- Prefer `pnpm check` before finishing non-trivial TS changes.

# New apps from boiler

Set unique `DB_TABLE_PREFIX`, run `pnpm db:push`, never commit `.env`.
